+ * when the gate is open.
+ *
+ * The form is deliberately **incremental**, never component-wise. The
+ * mathematically equivalent `W×T + 0.2×N` sums the same evidence in a different
+ * order and lands on different last bits, which would force the identity check
+ * to compare with a tolerance and lose its teeth. Here `terminalGateWeight = 0.2`
+ * adds exactly `+0`, so the gated score is the production score bit for bit —
+ * and with the weight absent the term is not computed at all.
